<title>TAIWAN: Winbond raises '97 pre-tax forecast.</title>
<headline>Winbond raises '97 pre-tax forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Winbond Electronics Corp, one of the island's leading chipmakers, said on Monday it was raising its 1997 pre-tax profit forecast to T$2.43 billion from T$550 million.  </p>
<p>Winbond also would raise its 1997 sales target to T$13.09 billion from T$12.2 billion, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Winbond, Taiwan's third largest maker of microchips, attributed the expected increases in sales and profits to a strong global recovery in the semiconductor industry.</p>
